## Development

Run the server normally:

```bash
cargo run
```

Run the development server with automatic restart:

```bash
cargo dev
```

This command requires [watchexec](https://github.com/watchexec/watchexec):

```bash
cargo install watchexec-cli --locked
```

# Development: colored, human-readable logs
LOG_FORMAT=pretty cargo run

# Production or log collectors: structured JSON logs
LOG_FORMAT=json cargo run

When a Rust source file or `Cargo.toml` is modified, the project is rebuilt
and the server is restarted automatically.

Press `Ctrl+C` to stop the watcher.